  "description": "<p data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"669\">This beautifully crafted <strong data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"425\">Ceramic and Rattan Plate</strong> combines the elegance of glazed ceramic with the warmth of natural handwoven rattan. The inner plate is made from durable ceramic—smooth, glossy, and food-safe—while the outer frame is woven entirely by hand using sustainably harvested rattan.</p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"957\">Perfect for serving snacks, fruits, desserts, or as a decorative piece in modern and rustic interiors, this plate brings together both <strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"839\">function and aesthetic appeal</strong>. Its natural materials and artisan finish make it a unique choice for eco-conscious consumers and hospitality brands.</p>\n<p data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1177\">We offer <strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"993\">OEM/ODM customization</strong> in size, color, pattern, and packaging. Whether you are a homeware retailer, restaurant, hotel, or distributor, this plate is an excellent addition to your eco-friendly product range.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1182\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1206\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1206\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1612\">\n<li data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1280\">\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1280\">Combination of glazed <strong data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1249\">ceramic center</strong> and handwoven <strong data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1278\">rattan rim</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1348\">\n<p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1348\">Elegant and natural appearance suitable for serving and display</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1400\">\n<p data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1400\">100% handcrafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1442\">\n<p data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1442\">Food-safe, durable, and easy to clean</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1499\">\n<p data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1499\">Available in multiple sizes, shapes, and color tones</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1554\">\n<p data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1554\">Custom branding and packaging for wholesale buyers</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1612\">\n<p data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1612\">Ideal for homeware stores, hotels, resorts, and gifting</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1617\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1646\">🌱 <strong data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1644\">Why It Matters:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"2109\">This product represents the <strong data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1724\">spirit of Vietnam’s traditional craftsmanship</strong>, using almost entirely <strong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1787\">local raw materials and local labor</strong>. It supports <strong data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1822\">rural communities</strong>, creating extra income for farmers during off-seasons, and preserves a cultural heritage of hand weaving and ceramic art.<br data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1947\" />At Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd, we are proud to export sustainable craft products that generate foreign income while carrying the beauty of our culture worldwide.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2114\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2150\">✉️ <strong data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2148\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2331\">Looking for a <strong data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2236\">reliable ceramic &amp; rattan plate manufacturer or supplier in Vietnam</strong>?<br data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2240\" />📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2273\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2276\" />🌐 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"http://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopene